From 5bccedb9668d24dce7aad851115e6d6443a1d720 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 08:01:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Lane holding: heartbeat and stall windows; a stalled
 session is never elected

Owner, 2026-11-07: any agent may stall, the merge manager included.
holding gains heartbeatMinutes and stalledAfterMinutes; isStalled() reads
the stall window; electHolder() drops stalled candidates, so a stalled
lone session leaves the lane vacant. Tests for each.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VQDpPc2tT1vUufdyDbQTBz
---
 schemas/process/role-graph.test.ts | 20 ++++++++++++++++++++
 schemas/process/role-graph.ts      | 26 ++++++++++++++++++++++----
 2 files changed, 42 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

